{"title": "Absorb Intellect", "pageid": 18902, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Absorb_Intellect", "categories": ["Class actions", "Intelligence saving throws", "Actions", "Illithid Powers", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the illithid power. For the upgraded <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">full-illithid</a> version, see <a href=\"/wiki/Synaptic_Consumption\" title=\"Synaptic Consumption\">Synaptic Consumption</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Absorb_Intellect.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Absorb_Intellect.webp/300px-Absorb_Intellect.webp, /w/images/8/85/Absorb_Intellect.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Absorb_Intellect.webp/300px-Absorb_Intellect.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Absorb_Intellect.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Absorb Intellect</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> which saps a target's <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> and heals the user over time. The healing per turn and Intelligence reduction starts at <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> and -1 respectively and increases by a stacking <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> and -1 reduction each subsequent turn for 5 turns.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGobble up a foe's intellect, lowering their <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> by 1 per turn and healing your wounds for 5 turns.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Healing: 15~120</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:12px;padding-top:21px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:4;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/26px-D8_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/40px-D8_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/53px-D8_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/26px-D8_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/D8_Healing.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:3;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/26px-D8_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/40px-D8_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/53px-D8_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/D8_Healing.png/26px-D8_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/